<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealanders make more overseas trips in Apr-SNZ.</title>
<headline>New Zealanders make more overseas trips in Apr-SNZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand residents left for 93,320 short trips overseas in April, 4.0 percent more than in April 1996, Statistics New Zealand said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
